# PHP examples

Sample handlers for Stagepass projects with `"php": true`. Copy into `api/` (or another path under the project root) before calling them on `https://{{NAME}}.sp`.

| File | Purpose |
| :--- | :--- |
| `form.php` | POST form handler with length limits and `htmlspecialchars` output |
| `proxy.php` | HTTPS proxy with an exact-host allowlist (no redirect following) |

## Proxy environment

```bash
export STAGEPASS_PROXY_ALLOWLIST=api.example.com
# optional:
export STAGEPASS_PROXY_TOKEN=...
```

Never commit tokens. Keep allowlists exact hosts only (no wildcards, https only).
